{"seq":1,"slug":"why-semi-supervised","title":"为何半监督：标注瓶颈与无标签数据的价值","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/semi-supervised-learning/foundations/why-semi-supervised","wordCount":1662,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"为何半监督-标注瓶颈与无标签数据的价值\">为何半监督：标注瓶颈与无标签数据的价值</h1><p>一家自动驾驶公司的感知团队做过一次内部核算：一张街景图像里所有目标框、车道线、可行驶区域的像素级标注，熟练标注员要花约 90 分钟，成本折合数十美元；而车队每天回传的原始图像以百万计，几乎零成本。这个悬殊的比例——标签贵到令人却步、样本多到用不完——就是半监督学习存在的全部理由。监督学习的精度天花板往往不由模型架构决定，而由「你标得起多少数据」决定。半监督学习要做的，是把那 99% 没标注的图像也变成有用的训练信号。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-标签稀缺下的学习问题\">核心概念：标签稀缺下的学习问题</h2><p>形式化地说，我们手里有一个很小的有标签集 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>l</mi></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_l = \\{(x_i, y_i)\\}_{i=1}^{l}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1078em;vertical-align:-0.2587em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">}</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4413em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2587em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 和一个大得多的无标签集 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>u</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>l</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>l</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>u</mi></mrow></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_u = \\{x_j\\}_{j=l+1}^{l+u}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3267em;vertical-align:-0.4374em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">}</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8892em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3987em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1031em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4374em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，通常 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>≫</mo><mi>l</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u \\gg l</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≫</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span>。纯监督学习只用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>l</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_l</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 训练，忽略 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>u</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_u</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>；半监督学习则要同时利用两者，目标是学到比只用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>l</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_l</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 更好的模型。它与几种相邻范式的位置关系如下表。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>范式</th>\n<th>训练用的标签</th>\n<th>无标签数据角色</th>\n<th>典型问题</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>监督学习</td>\n<td>全部样本有标签</td>\n<td>不使用</td>\n<td>标签充足时的分类/回归</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>半监督学习</td>\n<td>少量样本有标签</td>\n<td>直接参与下游训练</td>\n<td>标签稀缺、无标签海量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自监督学习</td>\n<td>训练表征时不用标签</td>\n<td>用于预训练表征</td>\n<td>学通用表征再微调</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主动学习</td>\n<td>逐步索取标签</td>\n<td>候选池，挑最该标的</td>\n<td>标注预算有限、可交互</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>弱监督</td>\n<td>廉价不精确标签</td>\n<td>由规则/远程监督生成</td>\n<td>有噪声标注函数</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>半监督与自监督的分界最容易混：自监督（如对比学习、掩码建模）在预训练阶段完全不碰下游标签，产出的是可迁移的表征，细节见 <a href=\"../../../ai-llm/self-supervised-contrastive/foundations/ssl-paradigm\">自监督与对比学习</a>；半监督则在训练时就把少量标签和大量无标签一起喂进去、直接优化目标任务。二者并非对立，2020 年后的强方法常先自监督预训练、再半监督微调。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[海量无标签数据 D_u] --&gt; C{如何利用}&#10;  B[少量有标签数据 D_l] --&gt; C&#10;  C --&gt;|直接联合训练| D[半监督学习&lt;br/&gt;本 hub]&#10;  C --&gt;|先学表征再微调| E[自监督预训练]&#10;  C --&gt;|主动挑样本去标注| F[主动学习]&#10;  D --&gt; G[伪标签 / 一致性 / 图 / 生成 / 协同]&#10;  G --&gt; H[比纯监督更高的精度]\">flowchart TD\n  A[海量无标签数据 D_u] --&gt; C{如何利用}\n  B[少量有标签数据 D_l] --&gt; C\n  C --&gt;|直接联合训练| D[半监督学习&lt;br/&gt;本 hub]\n  C --&gt;|先学表征再微调| E[自监督预训练]\n  C --&gt;|主动挑样本去标注| F[主动学习]\n  D --&gt; G[伪标签 / 一致性 / 图 / 生成 / 协同]\n  G --&gt; H[比纯监督更高的精度]</pre><h2 id=\"无标签数据的价值从哪来\">无标签数据的价值从哪来</h2><p>一个关键的困惑是：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>u</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_u</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 里没有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span>，它凭什么改善对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p(y|x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的估计？答案是——无标签数据揭示的是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的形状，而 SSL 之所以奏效，恰恰是因为我们相信 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p(y|x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 之间有关联。举一个一维直觉：假设两个类别各自是一个高斯团，只给你每类一个带标签的点，你几乎画不准分界；但如果再给你几百个无标签点，你会清楚看到「两坨密集区之间有一条稀疏的低密度带」，最优决策边界显然该落在那条带上。无标签数据没有直接告诉你标签，却告诉了你「边界不该穿过密集区」。</p>\n<p>这个直觉的严格版本就是三大假设——平滑性、聚类（低密度分离）、流形，它们是 SSL 全部合法性的来源，数学细节留在 <a href=\"ssl-assumptions\">三大假设</a> 详述，此处只需记住：无标签数据的价值 = <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的结构 × 「结构与标签相关」这个假设。当这个假设成立时，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>D</mi><mi>u</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D_u</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 越多，你对边界该躲开哪里的判断就越准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"免费午餐的反面-ssl-也会帮倒忙\">免费午餐的反面：SSL 也会帮倒忙</h2><p>半监督最容易被忽视的一课是：如果上述假设不成立，无标签数据会让模型变差，而非变好。这不是理论上的杞人忧天。Oliver 等人在 NeurIPS 2018 的著名「现实评测」里就展示过：当无标签数据里混入了有标签集里根本没有的类别（类别失配），几种当时主流的 SSL 方法性能会掉到连纯监督基线都不如。原因是模型会自信地把这些「域外」样本也硬塞进已知类别，污染决策边界。</p>\n<p>因此判断「要不要上 SSL」时，先问三个问题：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>假设成立吗？</strong> 你的类别在特征空间里真的成团、被低密度带隔开吗？文本、图像通常成立，高度重叠的表格数据未必。</li>\n<li><strong>无标签池干净吗？</strong> 里面混进多少训练集没有的新类别？失配严重时先做过滤，详见 <a href=\"../practice/class-mismatch\">类别失配</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>纯监督基线真的调到位了吗？</strong> 很多「SSL 提升」在把监督基线的数据增强和正则调足后就消失了。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"何时用-何时别用\">何时用、何时别用</h2><p>一句话决策：<strong>当标签极少（每类几个到几十个）、无标签样本海量且与标签数据同分布、任务的类别有清晰聚类结构时，SSL 收益最大。</strong> 反过来，当你已能标到每类上千样本、或无标签数据分布漂移严重、或类别本就高度重叠时，投入产出比会迅速下降，这时把精力放在 <a href=\"../../active-learning-data-labeling/practice/cost-stopping-criteria\">主动学习</a> 挑样本去标注、或直接买标注，往往更划算。落地时更完整的决策清单见 <a href=\"../practice/semi-supervised-in-practice\">落地与边界</a>。</p>\n<p>需要强调，SSL 的收益是「边际递减」的：从 40 个标签涨到 250 个标签时，无标签数据的相对贡献最大；一旦标签量进入几千级，纯监督就逐渐追平，无标签数据的额外价值被稀释。这条曲线的形状，本身就是你决定标注预算该花在哪里的依据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>半监督学习的动机是标注成本与数据规模的巨大落差：标签贵、样本多。</li>\n<li>无标签数据的价值来自它揭示的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 结构，前提是相信结构与标签相关（三大假设）。</li>\n<li>假设不成立或无标签池含域外类别时，SSL 会帮倒忙——这不是免费午餐。</li>\n<li>决策三问：假设成立吗、无标签池干净吗、监督基线调到位了吗。</li>\n<li>收益随标签量增加而边际递减，极低标签区间收益最大。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>本 hub：<a href=\"ssl-assumptions\">三大假设</a> 把本篇的「价值来源」严格化；<a href=\"ssl-taxonomy\">谱系</a> 给出方法全景。</li>\n<li>本 hub：<a href=\"../practice/semi-supervised-in-practice\">落地与边界</a> 是本篇决策问题的完整版。</li>\n<li>跨库：<a href=\"../../active-learning-data-labeling/foundations/why-labeling-bottleneck\">主动学习——标注瓶颈</a> 从「主动挑样本」的对偶角度谈同一个成本问题。</li>\n<li>跨库：<a href=\"../../../ai-llm/self-supervised-contrastive/foundations/ssl-paradigm\">自监督范式</a> 讲无标签数据的另一种用法——预训练表征。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>来源：Oliver et al., &quot;Realistic Evaluation of Deep Semi-Supervised Learning Algorithms&quot; (NeurIPS 2018, arXiv:1804.09170)；Sohn et al., FixMatch (arXiv:2001.07685)。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"为何半监督：标注瓶颈与无标签数据的价值","id":"为何半监督-标注瓶颈与无标签数据的价值"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：标签稀缺下的学习问题","id":"核心概念-标签稀缺下的学习问题"},{"level":2,"text":"无标签数据的价值从哪来","id":"无标签数据的价值从哪来"},{"level":2,"text":"免费午餐的反面：SSL 也会帮倒忙","id":"免费午餐的反面-ssl-也会帮倒忙"},{"level":2,"text":"何时用、何时别用","id":"何时用-何时别用"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"三大假设：半监督成立的三条公理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/semi-supervised-learning/foundations/ssl-assumptions"}}